        "snippet": "# DocGo (DCGO) Q1 2026 Earnings\n\n- Stock: DCGO\n- Call ID: US_DCGO_2026-05-11\n- Date: 2026-05-11\n- Type: Earnings call\n\n## Spokespersons\n\n- Mike Cole (Vice President of Investor Relations)\n- Lee Bienstock (CEO & Director)\n- Norman Rosenberg (Treasurer & CFO)\n- Operator (Operator)\n- Analyst (Analyst)\n\n## Summary\n\nDocGo Inc. reported Q1 2026 revenue of $75.6 million, surpassing expectations, alongside an adjusted EBITDA loss of $10.2 million. The company raised its full-year 2026 revenue guidance to $300–$315 million (from $290–$310 million) but left adjusted EBITDA guidance unchanged at a loss of $5–$10 million. Revenue growth was driven by SteadyMD's virtual care platform, which generated $9.5 million in Q1 (up from ~$8.5 million in Q4 2025) and completed 1.1 million visits/lab orders (+38% YoY). Mobile phlebotomy and CareGap closure services also contributed strong growth, while the Medical Transportation segment posted record revenue of $51.9 million. Margins were pressured by fuel co",
